      "text": "02 · 开始使用",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang TC",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "mac-guide-zh-CN-10",
      "boardId": "heiban-macos-quickstart-v3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 2570,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 800,
      "rotation": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "zIndex": 10,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页＋建立笔记本、无边界或有边界画布，可选名称、背景与尺寸；搜寻、收藏、批次选择与垃圾桶用来管理作品。新设定默认关闭自动存档，保留既有偏好。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang TC",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "mac-guide-zh-CN-11",
      "boardId": "heiban-macos-quickstart-v3",
      "type": "circle",
      "x": 1280,
