      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "08 · 线段、箭头、形状与曲线",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang TC",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "mac-guide-zh-CN-40",
      "boardId": "heiban-macos-quickstart-v3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 9170,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 800,
      "rotation": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "zIndex": 40,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "画完保留绘图工具。矩形从角、圆／菱形／五角形／星形从中心拖画。三角三点、四边形四点直线预览；曲线可再调。磁铁约10画面点吸附首点及后续点到顶点、边中点、矩形中心、线段端中点、圆弧中心及四向点。隐藏对象排除，锁定图形可参照。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang TC",
      "align": "left"
    },
